    "caption": "⚡️DigitalOcean is providing its Cloud Credits for Astana Hub startups.\n\nWe are excited to partner with @thedigitalocean and their Hatch startup program to help support the next generation of builders and creators. Hatch is DigitalOcean's global startup program that helps startups grow and build in the cloud.\n\nAs part of Hatch, you'll gain access to:\n🔸 Up to $1000 worth of DigitalOcean's cloud for 12 months;\n🔸 Technical trainings, mentorship, and support from different experts in their field;\n🔸 Opportunities to connect with the global Hatch community through a dedicated Slack;\n🔸 Marketing help and promotions through DigitalOcean's social channels, newsletters and events;\n🔸 Invitations to exclusive networking events.\n\n❗️To apply, startups need to fill out the application form from the link in the profile description (taplink), selecting the DigitalОcean resource.",
